    <rich_text scale="h1">TEAM &amp; EXECUTIVE SYSTEM OVERVIEW</rich_text>
    <rich_text>

</rich_text>
    <rich_text scale="h2">1. Project Information</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Project:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> SchemaX Student Information System (SchemaX SIS)
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Course:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> CS 106 – Database Systems
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Institution:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> Bicol University
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Group:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> Group 3 – Team SchemaX
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">GitHub Repository:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> </rich_text>
    <rich_text link="webs https://github.com/reynalynsaavedrasamar25/SchemaX-SIS">https://github.com/reynalynsaavedrasamar25/SchemaX-SIS</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Final Release:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> </rich_text>
    <rich_text link="webs https://github.com/reynalynsaavedrasamar25/SchemaX-SIS/releases/tag/v1.1.0">https://github.com/reynalynsaavedrasamar25/SchemaX-SIS/releases/tag/v1.1.0</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
SchemaX SIS is an integrated student information system consisting of a Windows Forms desktop application and a .NET MAUI Android application. Both applications access a shared MySQL database for student record management, searching, and data retrieval. The desktop application also provides ScottPlot analytics.

</rich_text>
