    <rich_text scale="h2">3. High-Level System Architecture</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Windows Forms Desktop Application (.NET 10)</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
Student CRUD, search, ScottPlot charts, and dashboard refresh.
↓
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Shared MySQL Database (</rich_text>
    <rich_text family="monospace" weight="heavy">schemax_sis</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">)</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
Stores student records and supports database operations from both applications.
↑
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">.NET MAUI Android Application (.NET 10)</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
Student directory, search, navigation, and database connectivity.
The desktop application connects to the configured MySQL server. The Android emulator uses </rich_text>
    <rich_text family="monospace">10.0.2.2</rich_text>
    <rich_text> to reach MySQL on the host computer.


</rich_text>
