    <rich_text>
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Contributions:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> Team members worked on desktop analytics, mobile interface development, database connectivity, installer packaging, and documentation.
The repository commit history and pull requests provide evidence of collaborative development.

</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Final Capstone Release:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> </rich_text>
    <rich_text family="monospace">v1.1.0</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
Published deployment assets include the Windows MSI installer, setup executable, and Android APK packages.

