  <node unique_id="11" master_id="0" name="User &amp; Operator Manual" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1793782639" ts_lastsave="1795335682">
    <rich_text>
</rich_text>
    <rich_text scale="h1">USER &amp; OPERATOR MANUAL</rich_text>
    <rich_text>

</rich_text>
    <rich_text scale="h2">1. Desktop Dashboard User Manual</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Application:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> SchemaX SIS (Windows Forms)
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Main Features:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> Student CRUD, search, filtering, ScottPlot analytics, and dashboard refresh.
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Operating Instructions:</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
1. Launch SchemaX SIS and log in.

2. Open the student management section.

3. Add, view, edit, delete, or search student records.

4. Open the Dashboard to view student statistics.

5. Click </rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Refresh</rich_text>
    <rich_text> to update the charts using current database records.

</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Dashboard Analytics:</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
• Students per year level

• Students per program

• ScottPlot bar charts




</rich_text>
    <rich_text scale="h2">2. Mobile Directory User Manual</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Application:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> SchemaX Mobile (.NET MAUI Android)
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Main Features:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> Student directory, student details, search, and navigation.
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Operating Instructions:</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
1. Install and launch the Android application.

2. Log in if prompted.

3. Open the student directory.

4. Browse student cards to view information.

5. Use the search function to find a student.

6. Select a student to view additional details.

7. Refresh or reopen the directory to retrieve updated records.



</rich_text>
    <rich_text scale="h2">3. Troubleshooting &amp; FAQ Matrix</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Problem: Cannot connect to MySQL</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
Check whether the MySQL service is running, verify database credentials, and confirm the server address and port </rich_text>
    <rich_text family="monospace">3306</rich_text>
    <rich_text>.
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Problem: Desktop charts are not updating</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
Click </rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Refresh</rich_text>
    <rich_text> and verify that the database contains updated student records.
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Problem: Android student records are not loading</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
Check network connectivity. Use </rich_text>
    <rich_text family="monospace">10.0.2.2</rich_text>
    <rich_text> for the Android emulator or the server's reachable LAN IP for a physical device.
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Problem: Invalid student information</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
Check required fields, student ID format, and other validation requirements before saving.
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Problem: APK installation fails</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
Verify Android compatibility, APK integrity, and installation permissions.
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Problem: Changes do not appear across platforms</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
Confirm both applications use </rich_text>
    <rich_text family="monospace">schemax_sis</rich_text>
    <rich_text>. Refresh or retrieve the records again because synchronization is not automatically real-time.
</rich_text>
    <encoded_png char_offset="566" justification="left" link=""></encoded_png>
    <encoded_png char_offset="1059" justification="left" link=""></encoded_png>
  </node>
  <node unique_id="12" master_id="0" name="Verification &amp; System Test Matrix" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1793782678" ts_lastsave="1795336106">
    <rich_text>
</rich_text>
    <rich_text scale="h1">VERIFICATION &amp; SYSTEM TEST MATRIX</rich_text>
    <rich_text>

</rich_text>
    <rich_text scale="h2">1. Testing Overview</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
Team SchemaX conducted functional, integration, and deployment testing to verify the Student Information System.
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Previously Recorded Test Results:</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
• Automated Validator Testing — 25/25 PASS (October 16, 2026)

• Functional Testing — 14/14 PASS (October 17, 2026)

• Database Connectivity — PASS (October 22, 2026)

• Login and Registration — PASS (October 22, 2026)

• Student Record Retrieval — PASS (October 22, 2026)



</rich_text>
    <rich_text scale="h2">2. Functional &amp; Integration Test Cases</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-01: Student Registration and Validation</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
◇ Expected: Valid student information is accepted; invalid input is rejected.

◇ Result: PASS — Based on previously recorded validator and functional tests.


</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-02: Student Record Management</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
◇ Expected: Users can create, retrieve, update, and delete student records.

◇ Result: Previously recorded functional testing passed; final capstone CRUD verification should be confirmed.


</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-03: Desktop Dashboard Analytics</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
◇ Expected: ScottPlot displays student statistics and refreshes after updated records are retrieved.

◇ Result: Final test evidence required.


</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-04: Android Student Directory</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
◇ Expected: The mobile application retrieves and displays student information from MySQL.

◇ Result: Final test evidence required.


</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-05: Cross-Platform Data Synchronization</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Procedure:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> Updated a student record in the Windows desktop application and refreshed the Android student directory.
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Expected Result:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> The updated student information appears on both platforms.
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Actual Result:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> The updated student record successfully appeared in the Android application after refreshing.
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Status: PASS</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Conclusion:</rich_text>
    <rich_text> Cross-platform data synchronization was successfully verified through the shared MySQL database.
</rich_text>
    <rich_text justification="left"></rich_text>
    <rich_text>

</rich_text>
    <rich_text scale="h2">3. Deployment Verification &amp; Bonus Features</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Windows MSI Installer</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
◇ Build and installation: Previously verified successful.

◇ Final release: </rich_text>
    <rich_text family="monospace">SchemaX.SIS.Setup.msi</rich_text>
    <rich_text> and </rich_text>
    <rich_text family="monospace">setup.exe</rich_text>
    <rich_text>.


</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Android APK</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
◇ Signing verification: Previously recorded PASS (APK Signature Scheme v3).

◇ Final release: </rich_text>
    <rich_text family="monospace">SchemaX-SIS-Final-v2.apk</rich_text>
    <rich_text>.


</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Bonus / Additional Features</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
◇ Student search and filtering

◇ Dashboard refresh functionality

◇ Student input validation

◇ GitHub-based collaboration and version control


These features are documented as project functionality; bonus credit is subject to instructor evaluation.

</rich_text>
    <rich_text weight="heavy">Testing Conclusion</rich_text>
    <rich_text>
Previously recorded tests support the system's validation, database connectivity, and deployment functionality. Final cross-platform synchronization and dashboard refresh evidence should be attached when verified.
</rich_text>
